  kind: 1
  title: "\u0110\xEAm nh\xE0 \u2014 ng\xE0y 14 (th\u01B0 gi\xE3n)"
  intro: "\xD4n ki\u1EC3u chill: tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi sai c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng sao. S\xE1ng
    mai tr\xEAn l\u1EDBp m\u1EDBi \"h\u01A1i\" g\u1EAFt h\u01A1n."
  questions:
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 14] T\u1EA1i sao highlighter h\u1ED3ng
      l\u1EA1i nguy hi\u1EC3m?"
    options:
    - "V\xEC n\xF3 qu\xE1 \u0111\u1EB9p n\xEAn b\u1EA1n highlight c\u1EA3\u2026 c\u1EA3m
      x\xFAc"
    - "V\xEC gi\xE1o vi\xEAn kh\xF4ng th\xEDch m\xE0u h\u1ED3ng"
    - "V\xEC h\u1ED3ng l\xE0 warning color"
    - "V\xEC n\xF3 l\xE0m b\u1EA1n t\u01B0\u1EDFng m\xECnh \u0111\xE3 h\u1ECDc"
    correctIndex: 3
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 14] M\u1ED9t 'chi\xEAu' tr\xE1nh procrastination
      (phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n meme) l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "\u0110\u1EB7t b\xE1o th\u1EE9c t\xEAn 'S\u1EE3 th\u1EA7y'"
    - "\u0110\u1ED5i t\xEAn Wi-Fi th\xE0nh 'L\xE0m b\xE0i \u0111i'"
    - "M\u1EDF Word tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi m\u1EDF TikTok (hy v\u1ECDng)"
    - "T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EC1u\u2026 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 th\u1EED"
    correctIndex: 3
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 14] Khi b\u1EA1n h\u1ECDc nh\xF3m online,
      bi\u1EBFn c\u1ED1 n\xE0o hay nh\u1EA5t?"
    options:
    - "Qu\xEAn unmute khi ch\u1EEDi \u0111\u1EC1"
    - "Share nh\u1EA7m m\xE0n h\xECnh tab shopping"
    - Cat walk qua keyboard
    - "T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EC1u oscar-worthy"
    correctIndex: 3
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 14] Ch\u1ECDn 'power-up' th\u1EF1c t\u1EBF
      nh\u1EA5t:"
    options:
    - "N\u01B0\u1EDBc + ng\u1EE7 \u0111\u1EE7 + chia nh\u1ECF vi\u1EC7c"
    - "N\u01B0\u1EDBc t\u0103ng l\u1EF1c v\u1ECB\u2026 lo l\u1EAFng"
    - Podcast 3x speed
    - "\u0110\u1ED5i avatar th\xE0nh mode serious"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 14] T\u1ED1i nay b\u1EA1n x\u1EE9ng
      \u0111\xE1ng reward n\xE0o (vui)?"
    options:
    - "1 t\u1EADp phim 'd\xE0i 5 ph\xFAt'"
    - "Scroll 10 ph\xFAt (40 ph\xFAt)"
    - "\u0102n m\xF3n y\xEAu th\xEDch"
    - "T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 \u2014 theo ch\u1EBF \u0111\u1ED9 'balance'"
    correctIndex: 2
    explanation: 
